---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import ClaimBlock from '../components/ClaimBlock.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import { release } from '../lib/publication';
import { url } from '../lib/publication';
const stages = [['1','Announcement','A public statement or press release.'],['2','Notification','The formal order and jurisdiction.'],['3','Sanction','An authorized budget or allocation.'],['4','Release','Funds actually transferred.'],['5','Implementation','Records of work or service delivered.'],['6','Outcome','Measured result for the intended population.']];
const selectedClaims = ['C-JJM-FUNDS-20260331'].map(id => release.claims.find(c => c.id === id)).filter(Boolean);
---
<Site title="Institutional response"><PageHeader title="From promise to outcome" eyebrow="Public response" description="A dated announcement, a legal order, money released and water delivered are different stages. We track each separately." /><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Evidence</th><th>What it establishes</th></tr></thead><tbody>{stages.map(([n,name,meaning]) => <tr><td>{n}</td><td>{name}</td><td>{meaning}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><div class="note"><strong>Current local tracker status</strong><p>No state or district action is entered as verified in this build. An empty record means not checked or not supported; it does not establish that an authority did nothing.</p></div><h2>Documents to ask for</h2><p>For any claimed response, request the original order, its date and place, a sanction and release record, implementation documents and a dated outcome measure. Verify current rules before stating that an older guideline remains operative.</p><a href={url('/journalists/')}>Reporting question bank ↗</a></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell reading"><p class="eyebrow">Reviewed, attributed source records</p><h2>Documented programme step</h2><p>The ministry release reports an approval, guidelines and a fund release. It does not verify expenditure, completed work or an outcome.</p>{selectedClaims[0] && <ClaimBlock claim={selectedClaims[0]} heading="Jal Jeevan Mission announcement and reported release" />}</div></section></Site>
